<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY TWO WICKETS IN TITAN TUP MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY TWO WICKETS IN TITAN TUP MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BANGALORE, India 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>India beat Australia by</p>
<p>two wickets in their Titan Cup one-day match on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 215 for seven (50 overs), India 216 for</p>
<p>eight (48.5).</p>
</text>
